<title>LATVIA: OFFICIAL SEES 1997 CARGO TRANSIT AT 50 MLN TONNES.</title>
<headline>OFFICIAL SEES 1997 CARGO TRANSIT AT 50 MLN TONNES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian Transport Minister Vilis Kristopans said on Thursday that cargo transit in the Baltic state was expected to grow to 50 million tonnes in 1997 from 44.8 million tonnes in 1996.</p>
</text>
